# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Keeps the post-purchase page and its files out of search results even if a crawler ignores the page's own noindex tag.
# (Pages Functions handle only "/" and "/e", so these static paths are served as plain files with these headers.)
# Every static page and file (the home page is served by a Function, which sets the same list in shared/worker.ts SECURITY_HEADERS).
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
/thanks-*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cache-Control: no-store
/files/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
